@startuml cu81
!theme plain
title CU81 — Gestión de Trámites en Protocolo Auxiliar

actor "Client (Cliente)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : A client requests an auxiliary-protocol procedure.
System -> System : Client
Actor -> Actor : Requests the identification data and the procedure type.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The receptionist enters the client data.
System -> System : Receptionist
Actor -> Actor : Looks up the client or allows quick registration if the client is new.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) starts drafting the deed in Protocolo Auxiliar.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Presents Protocolo Auxiliar folios and assigns a consecutive number.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) drafts the body of the record and links it to the folios.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Validates the integrity of the text and the folio sequence.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The client and the notary (Escribano) sign the auxiliary deed on paper.
System -> System : Client
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) records that every party has signed the deed.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) requests generation of the testimony on notarial paper.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Generates the numbered testimony and records issuance of the document.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) delivers the testimony to the client.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Updates the procedure status to "Finalizado / Entregado" without creating a physical folder.
System -> System : System

@enduml
